chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"CE1FdAHEnjo","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline (Evil Needle remix)","track":{"id":"yfsjos03hVk","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix/","slug":"add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix","title":"Add the Bassline (Evil Needle Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"BMB7jlljCrk","position":11,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline (Evil Needle Remix)","track":{"id":"yfsjos03hVk","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix/","slug":"add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix","title":"Add the Bassline (Evil Needle Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-evil-needle-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"JJgUaQe2BNo","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline (starRo remix)","track":{"id":"pnZWmx10m9E","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-starro-remix/","slug":"add-the-bassline-starro-remix","title":"Add the Bassline (starRo remix)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-starro-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"tAesujR_Nrc","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Shaclackclack the Puppet","track":{"id":"h5jpLs74oHE","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/shaclackclack-the-puppet/","slug":"shaclackclack-the-puppet","title":"Shaclackclack the Puppet","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/shaclackclack-the-puppet.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"YfRPxIw7dxc","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Shaclackclack the Puppet","track":{"id":"h5jpLs74oHE","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/shaclackclack-the-puppet/","slug":"shaclackclack-the-puppet","title":"Shaclackclack the Puppet","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/shaclackclack-the-puppet.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Ant5dMtK1vw","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline (Penthouse Penthouse rmx)","track":{"id":"CIKMPo6Y6b0","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx/","slug":"add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx","title":"Add the Bassline (Penthouse Penthouse rmx)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"nx0HxcR13tE","position":25,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add The Bassline (J-Louis Remix)","track":{"id":"N6TzpJmdTBs","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-j-louis-remix/","slug":"add-the-bassline-j-louis-remix","title":"Add The Bassline (J-Louis Remix)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"liNF_Uad_x0","slug":"151","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-151-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #151 w/ Mr. Choc (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/151.jpg","content":"\nFor this week's special guest if you want to talk about pioneers in the game [Mr. Choc](https://twitter.com/MrChocFan4) is one of them. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nOne of our favorite DJ's who's talent and accomplishments are not to be overlooked. \nRepresenting the world famous Beat Junkies crew and Skam Artists, the crew was blessed to have this man come by Kbeach and hit us with a set and great interview session. \nThe thing we admire the most about Choc is that he has his ears close to the new generation of music and understands the culture. \nHe threw down a really diverse set and kept us on our toes. \n\nJoe Kay was on his soulful chop vibe and has really been digging back into the classic neo-soul/boombap sound. \nMake sure you really pay attention to the interview at the end. \nSome great insight on commercial radio on the west coast as well as opportunities for upcoming DJ's. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"z3Vss3s1mDs","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline","track":{"id":"5wJFYYhLa80","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline/","slug":"add-the-bassline","title":"Add the Bassline","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"liNF_Uad_x0","slug":"151","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-151-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #151 w/ Mr. Choc (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/151.jpg","content":"\nFor this week's special guest if you want to talk about pioneers in the game [Mr. Choc](https://twitter.com/MrChocFan4) is one of them. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nOne of our favorite DJ's who's talent and accomplishments are not to be overlooked. \nRepresenting the world famous Beat Junkies crew and Skam Artists, the crew was blessed to have this man come by Kbeach and hit us with a set and great interview session. \nThe thing we admire the most about Choc is that he has his ears close to the new generation of music and understands the culture. \nHe threw down a really diverse set and kept us on our toes. \n\nJoe Kay was on his soulful chop vibe and has really been digging back into the classic neo-soul/boombap sound. \nMake sure you really pay attention to the interview at the end. \nSome great insight on commercial radio on the west coast as well as opportunities for upcoming DJ's. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"yiykTJJIQbE","position":53,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline","track":{"id":"5wJFYYhLa80","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline/","slug":"add-the-bassline","title":"Add the Bassline","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"G8aZuw4mqt8","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Selfish (Sh?m Bootleg remix)","track":{"id":"jXxuMbP5geA","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/selfish-sh-m-bootleg-remix/","slug":"selfish-shm-bootleg-remix","title":"Selfish (Sh?m Bootleg remix)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/selfish-sh-m-bootleg-remix.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"5O03vFTJaRU","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jordan Rakei - Add the Bassline (Penthouse Penthouse rmx)","track":{"id":"CIKMPo6Y6b0","path":"/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx/","slug":"add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx","title":"Add the Bassline (Penthouse Penthouse rmx)","artist":{"slug":"jordan-rakei","title":"Jordan Rakei"},"artwork":"images/artists/jordan-rakei/tracks/add-the-bassline-penthouse-penthouse-rmx.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dmevNeYyuRE","slug":"179","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soun